{
  "id": "single-number",
  "order": 18,
  "title": "Single Number",
  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "pattern": "Bit manipulation",
  "statement": "Every element of `nums` appears exactly twice except one. Return that single element, using O(1) extra space.",
  "constraints": [
    "1 <= nums.length <= 3 * 10^4",
    "-3 * 10^4 <= nums[i] <= 3 * 10^4"
  ],
  "function": {
    "name": "singleNumber",
    "params": [
      {
        "name": "nums",
        "type": "int[]"
      }
    ],
    "returns": "int"
  },
  "complexity": {
    "time": "O(n)",
    "space": "O(1)"
  },
  "hints": [
    "A hash set works but uses O(n) space. Which operation cancels equal values?",
    "x ^ x = 0 and x ^ 0 = x. XOR is also order-independent.",
    "XOR all the numbers together; the pairs cancel and the single number remains."
  ],
  "tests": [
    {
      "args": [
        [
          2,
          2,
          1
        ]
      ],
      "expected": 1,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "1 appears once."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          4,
          1,
          2,
          1,
          2
        ]
      ],
      "expected": 4,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "4 appears once."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          1
        ]
      ],
      "expected": 1,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          -1,
          5,
          5
        ]
      ],
      "expected": -1,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          0,
          7,
          7
        ]
      ],
      "expected": 0,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          3,
          -3,
          3
        ]
      ],
      "expected": -3,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          8,
          -24,
          -24
        ]
      ],
      "expected": 8,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          -4,
          -11,
          -11
        ]
      ],
      "expected": -4,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          -41
        ]
      ],
      "expected": -41,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          -22,
          15,
          20,
          -23,
          12,
          20,
          12,
          8,
          15,
          7,
          8,
          7,
          -22
        ]
      ],
      "expected": -23,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          -48,
          39,
          29,
          39,
          11,
          29,
          11
        ]
      ],
      "expected": -48,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          22,
